NAME
       img - view an image on the framebuffer

SYNOPSIS
       img <file>

DESCRIPTION
       Draws a PNG, JPEG, BMP, SVG or GIF scaled to fit the screen.
       Animated GIFs loop until a key is pressed; still images wait for
       a key.

EXAMPLES
       img /usr/share/media/giphy.gif

SEE ALSO
       cfm(1), fbdemo(1)
